175
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:11,820
Defeating two upper ranks without losing your lives was noble of you.

176
00:13:11,820 --> 00:13:14,820
Something's different about you two.

177
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:16,820
And your wounds healed abnormally quickly.

178
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:18,820
