179
00:13:18,820 --> 00:13:23,820
Concerning their changes, I trust the Master will explain everything.

180
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:32,820
Thank you all for patiently waiting.

181
00:13:32,820 --> 00:13:40,820
Today's Hashira meeting will be conducted by myself as a stand-in for Kaguya Ubuyashiki.

182
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:49,820
You see, his conditions worsened, and therefore Kaguya, the head of our family, can never appear before you again.

183
00:13:49,820 --> 00:13:50,820
