184
00:13:50,820 --> 00:13:52,820
I know this must be hard.

185
00:13:52,820 --> 00:14:09,820
Understood.

186
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:12,820
I pray that the Master finds the strength.

187
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:17,820
The strength to let the light of his life continue burning, even one day longer.

188
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:21,820
And I pray that you can stay strong yourself, Lady Amane.

189
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:28,820
From the bottom of my heart, I want to thank each and every one of you.

190
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:32,820
