191
00:14:32,820 --> 00:14:36,820
But now that a demon who's conquered sunlight has appeared,

192
00:14:36,820 --> 00:14:41,820
it's a given that Muzan Kibutsuji will make a frenzied attempt to come after her,

193
00:14:41,820 --> 00:14:44,820
so that he, too, can conquer the sun.

194
00:14:44,820 --> 00:14:48,820
An all-out war of immense scale is approaching us.

195
00:14:48,820 --> 00:14:57,820
But there is hope that was given to us by Lady Kanroji and Lord Tokito.

196
00:14:57,820 --> 00:15:03,820
I'm told that a unique-looking mark appeared on the both of you during your previous battle.

197
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:10,820
I ask of you, please teach us what you two did to manifest your marks in battle.

198
00:15:10,820 --> 00:15:12,820
Our marks?

199
00:15:12,820 --> 00:15:22,820
During the Sengoku period, the swordsmen of first breathing who had driven Muzan Kibutsuji to the brink of defeat.

200
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:31,820
What they all shared in common was the mark each of them bore, a mark similar to demonic patterns.

201
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:36,820
There are those who are aware of this, having heard through word of mouth.

202
00:15:36,820 --> 00:15:41,820
It's the first time I'm hearing of it. Why has this been kept secret from us?

203
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:48,820
Many swordsmen sought to manifest a mark, and brooded over not having one appear despite their efforts.

204
00:15:48,820 --> 00:15:54,820
That is why, much of the lore surrounding this mark remains shrouded in mystery.

205
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:59,820
Perhaps because at the time, it was not seen as vital enough to preserve.

206
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:07,820
Or perhaps because there was no one to pass it on to during the many times the Demon Slayer core faced annihilation.

207
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:13,820
There only remains a single record that describes the manifestation of these marks.

208
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:22,820
When one person bearing the mark appears, those around him also manifest marks as if resonating with him.

209
00:16:27,820 --> 00:16:34,820
One of the first breathing swordsmen wrote this in his notes. That's the only clue we have to work with.

210
00:16:34,820 --> 00:16:39,820
However, the first person of our generation to have the mark has appeared.

211
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:49,820
Shockingly, that person is not a Hashira, but Lord Tanjiro Kamado. The first person to bear the mark.

212
00:16:50,820 --> 00:16:58,820
The only problem is that he himself seemed unable to describe exactly how his mark appeared, so we decided to revisit it another time.

213
00:16:58,820 --> 00:17:03,820
But now, in Lord Kamado's wake, two Hashira have manifested the mark.

214
00:17:03,820 --> 00:17:07,820
Please enlighten us, Lady Kanroji, Lord Tokito.

215
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:09,820
Lady Kanroji, Lord Tokito.

216
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:16,820
Oh, right! Lady Amane is so gorgeous!

217
00:17:16,820 --> 00:17:22,820
Well, you see, when it happened…

218
00:17:23,820 --> 00:17:28,820
My body felt extremely light! Really light! Lighter than usual!

219
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:30,820
Let's see…

220
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:32,820
Um…

221
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:34,820
And then…

222
00:17:35,820 --> 00:17:36,820
And then…

223
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:40,820
Bam!

224
00:17:40,820 --> 00:17:41,820
Throughout my body!

225
00:17:41,820 --> 00:17:43,820
My limbs went bam!

226
00:17:43,820 --> 00:17:45,820
And my mind went pow!

227
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:47,820
And I remember my heart pounding like crazy!

228
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:50,820
And my ears were going ding ding!

229
00:17:50,820 --> 00:17:52,820
And ripple ripple! Ripple!

230
00:17:52,820 --> 00:18:10,820
I'm so sorry, forgive me! I wish I could crawl into a hole right now!

231
00:18:13,820 --> 00:18:16,820
Perhaps I can be of help.

232
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:21,820
It's not as if I was aware of the mark manifesting.

233
00:18:22,820 --> 00:18:27,820
But when I think about the battle that took place when it did, some things come to mind.

234
00:18:28,820 --> 00:18:30,820
Things that, when looking back at it, were out of the ordinary.

235
00:18:31,820 --> 00:18:36,820
As long as certain conditions are met, I believe that the mark will appear on everyone.

236
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:40,820
I'll now explain those conditions and how I met them.

237
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:41,820
The End

238
00:18:41,820 --> 00:18:57,820
During the previous battle, I was badly poisoned and left unable to move.

239
00:18:58,820 --> 00:19:03,820
I tried to slow down the flow of the poison by using my breathing technique but before I could,

240
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:10,820
The boy who tried to save me was about to be killed in front of me, which brought back memories of the past.

241
00:19:11,820 --> 00:19:15,820
And the overwhelming rage I felt made me lose control of my emotions.

242
00:19:16,820 --> 00:19:20,820
I swear at that very moment, my heart rate was over 200.

243
00:19:22,820 --> 00:19:25,820
Furthermore, my body felt like it was on fire.

244
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:30,820
As for my temperature, I'm certain it was over 102 degrees.

245
00:19:30,820 --> 00:19:35,820
But how could you move in a state like that? Those conditions are fatal.

246
00:19:36,820 --> 00:19:37,820
Yes, that's correct.

247
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:41,820
I think that's the point, when those who aren't chosen are killed off.

248
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:49,820
Whether you die or survive in that moment determines whether you get the mark, or you become part of the past.

249
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:56,820
A heart rate over 200 beats a minute.

250
00:19:57,820 --> 00:20:00,820
But your temperature, how do you know it was over 102?

251
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:02,820
Right.

252
00:20:02,820 --> 00:20:07,820
