00:32:34,760 --> 00:32:37,920
All that's left is Mr. Tomioka.

529
00:32:42,860 --> 00:32:46,240
I finally managed to get back from my mission,

530
00:32:46,560 --> 00:32:47,780
and now we have to train?

531
00:32:48,140 --> 00:32:49,060
Just kill me.

532
00:32:49,660 --> 00:32:51,260
Are you heading there now, Zenni too?

533
00:32:51,940 --> 00:32:52,500
Unfortunately.

534
00:32:52,980 --> 00:32:56,220
And I heard that we have to train under every Hashira one by one!

535
00:32:56,640 --> 00:32:57,520
What? Really?

536
00:32:57,840 --> 00:32:58,660
That's great!

537
00:32:59,460 --> 00:33:01,600
There's nothing great about what I just said.

538
00:33:01,660 --> 00:33:02,860
It's awful and hellish.

539
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:05,620
Whoever thought up this torture, kill yourself.

540
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:06,200
Hey!

541
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:09,460
Getting to train with someone who's ranked above you is a privilege!

542
00:33:09,820 --> 00:33:11,520
And a shortcut to getting stronger!

543
00:33:12,080 --> 00:33:14,220
When you take on someone that's better than you,

544
00:33:14,380 --> 00:33:16,840
you can absorb what they teach you and put it into practice!

545
00:33:18,840 --> 00:33:19,340
Ah!

546
00:33:19,760 --> 00:33:19,960
Ah!

547
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:20,460
Ah!

548
00:33:23,460 --> 00:33:25,880
You're just gonna spew positive garbage!

549
00:33:26,100 --> 00:33:27,540
And you are, I don't know, all your friends!

550
00:33:27,600 --> 00:33:28,240
You got that!

551
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:31,100
It's so fine and dandy for you!

552
00:33:31,280 --> 00:33:33,940
Because you get to learn that comfy battle day where you recover!

553
00:33:34,300 --> 00:33:36,600
But I actually have to go out there and suffer!

554
00:33:37,020 --> 00:33:38,160
You know I have to hear!

555
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:39,140
I'm sorry!

556
00:33:39,460 --> 00:33:40,160
I'm sorry!

557
00:33:43,300 --> 00:33:44,440
Wait, Zenni too!

558
00:33:44,860 --> 00:33:46,100
Don't you dare talk to me!

559
00:33:46,840 --> 00:33:47,740
But it's important.

560
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:49,440
You saved me.

561
00:33:50,460 --> 00:33:51,100
Thank you.

562
00:33:53,780 --> 00:33:55,560
During the battle against Upper Four,

563
00:33:55,560 --> 00:33:57,640
when I lost the use of one of my legs,

564
00:33:57,640 --> 00:34:01,240
I remembered what you taught me about the thunder-breathing technique.

565
00:34:01,580 --> 00:34:02,680
And because of that,

566
00:34:02,780 --> 00:34:04,500
I was able to behead the demon!

567
00:34:06,860 --> 00:34:07,600
Of course,

568
00:34:07,840 --> 00:34:10,000
I couldn't do it nearly as fast as you.

569
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:11,720
But thank you.

570
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:14,300
It just goes to show you

571
00:34:14,300 --> 00:34:16,160
there are times when your connections to others

572
00:34:16,160 --> 00:34:17,040
can come in handy.

573
00:34:17,780 --> 00:34:20,140
So savor every moment of Hashira training.

574
00:34:20,140 --> 00:34:21,200
After all,

575
00:34:21,200 --> 00:34:23,280
it might lead you to a bright future.

576
00:34:28,880 --> 00:34:30,500
You little chipper idiot!

577
00:34:30,860 --> 00:34:33,680
Don't think flattery is going to put me in a better mood!

578
00:34:34,100 --> 00:34:35,500
Hey, he's happy now.

579
00:34:35,740 --> 00:34:36,500
Thank goodness.

580
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:37,940
See you, Tanjiro!

581
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:39,400
Get post soon, okay?

582
00:34:39,860 --> 00:34:40,360
Honestly,

583
00:34:40,740 --> 00:34:43,240
everyone's borderline helpless without me around.

584
00:34:43,240 --> 00:34:50,920
I owe you my life, Zenitsu.

585
00:34:51,700 --> 00:34:52,480
Thank you.

586
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:58,140
Too slow, too slow, too slow!

587
00:35:01,660 --> 00:35:03,560
What the hell are you punks doing?

588
00:35:03,900 --> 00:35:05,680
We're only just getting started here!

589
00:35:07,200 --> 00:35:07,760
Damn!

590
00:35:07,760 --> 00:35:08,520
Damn!

591
00:35:08,820 --> 00:35:10,320
You're in such miserable shape!

592
00:35:10,620 --> 00:35:12,360
I can't even call it this is running!

593
00:35:12,780 --> 00:35:15,020
I need you to run like you're being chased by a demon!

594
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:16,640
So get a move on!

595
00:35:17,860 --> 00:35:18,920
Now what's wrong?

596
00:35:19,060 --> 00:35:19,860
Who are you speechless?

597
00:35:20,260 --> 00:35:21,740
Who told you to crouch down?

598
00:35:21,980 --> 00:35:23,640
There's no time for taking breaks!

599
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:25,460
Get up and run!

600
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:27,300
I'm done.

601
00:35:27,620 --> 00:35:28,960
You can't be serious!

602
00:35:29,300 --> 00:35:30,940
The training from the active Hashira

603
00:35:30,940 --> 00:35:32,580
is going to be much harder than this!

604
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,300
It's nice seeing him like this.

605
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,400
He's much more fired up on the front lines.

606
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:39,020
Yeah, I know what you mean.

607
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:41,280
I just hope we can help out a little bit.

608
00:35:41,360 --> 00:35:42,780
They're bound to be famished.

609
00:35:43,220 --> 00:35:45,880
So let's make as many race balls as we can for them!

610
00:35:46,340 --> 00:35:46,640
Hmm.

611
00:35:56,800 --> 00:35:58,240
Hey, Lord Tengen!

612
00:35:58,500 --> 00:35:59,940
Lunch is just about ready!

613
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:01,360
Great!

614
00:36:01,900 --> 00:36:02,260
Hey!

615
00:36:02,820 --> 00:36:04,320
It's lunch time, you schmucks!

616
00:36:05,120 --> 00:36:05,960
Can't move.

617
00:36:05,960 --> 00:36:08,500
If I eat, I'm gonna puke!

618
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,180
Ugh!

619
00:36:10,180 --> 00:36:11,760
How pathetic are you?

620
00:36:12,640 --> 00:36:15,660
Lord Tengen, try not to be so angry with them.

621
00:36:16,180 --> 00:36:17,740
Look, I wish I didn't have to.

622
00:36:18,060 --> 00:36:20,660
But if I send them over in this sorry state to the next Hashira,

623
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,620
they're gonna blame me for their weakness.

624
00:36:23,180 --> 00:36:24,220
For you, Lord Tengen.

625
00:36:24,600 --> 00:36:25,020
Thanks.

626
00:36:25,220 --> 00:36:26,920
It's me so soup loaded with salt!

627
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:33,180
This is nothing compared to their training sessions.

628
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:34,040
Seriously!

629
00:36:35,580 --> 00:36:36,720
Hey, Lord Tengen.

630
00:36:37,020 --> 00:36:38,820
If you're in charge of boosting their stamina,

631
00:36:39,620 --> 00:36:41,940
well then, what will the other Hashira help with?

632
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:43,640
Well, if I remember right...

633
00:36:43,640 --> 00:36:47,100
First, they'll undergo Tokito's rapid movement training.

634
00:36:47,600 --> 00:36:51,040
That guy has such a deadpan look on his face while being super harsh.

635
00:36:51,620 --> 00:36:54,720
Next up is Konroji's flexibility training from hell.

636
00:36:55,520 --> 00:36:57,020
And from there, it's on to Igaro.

637
00:36:57,340 --> 00:36:58,780
He'll overhaul their sword skills.

638
00:36:58,980 --> 00:37:01,060
That serpent's one persistent trainer.

639
00:37:01,060 --> 00:37:02,900
Then, we have Shinazugawa.

640
00:37:03,320 --> 00:37:05,400
I hear it's called Infinite Slashing Training.

641
00:37:05,840 --> 00:37:07,980
As the name implies, there'll be no end to it.

642
00:37:08,720 --> 00:37:11,920
And finally, Mr. Himejima's Muscle Amplification Training.

643
00:37:12,240 --> 00:37:14,080
They get through that and they'll be superhuman.

644
00:37:15,100 --> 00:37:16,180
The Hashira will too.

645
00:37:16,760 --> 00:37:20,060
After all, they're gonna be taking on an endless stream of rookie swordsmen.

646
00:37:20,700 --> 00:37:23,500
I'm sure they'll end up boosting their own stamina doing it.

647
00:37:24,600 --> 00:37:25,800
Flashy, isn't it?

648
00:37:27,040 --> 00:37:28,780
This training sounds like fun.

649
00:37:29,240 --> 00:37:30,480
I'm a little jealous here.

650
00:37:31,060 --> 00:37:32,160
Good luck.

651
00:37:32,600 --> 00:37:33,860
I'm counting on you all.

652
00:37:35,940 --> 00:37:37,760
And all you got!

653
00:37:40,240 --> 00:37:44,140
At this rate, my temperature's never gonna go up!

654
00:37:44,360 --> 00:37:45,720
You're too damn weak!

655
00:37:47,640 --> 00:37:48,760
Not bad.

656
00:37:48,960 --> 00:37:50,120
You're almost there.

657
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,680
Let's spread them a little more, okay?

658
00:37:54,640 --> 00:37:58,180
There's no telling where the enemy will attack from next.

659
00:37:58,180 --> 00:38:01,640
Feel it.

660
00:38:01,640 --> 00:38:07,780
Your stance is so full of holes that a demon would have devoured you by now.

661
00:38:07,780 --> 00:38:11,760
In order to maintain the marked state that I've acquired.

662
00:38:12,480 --> 00:38:13,880
Ah, another opening.

663
00:38:13,880 --> 00:38:20,220
Everyone strive to do your best.

664
00:38:20,220 --> 00:38:20,560
Ah!

665
00:38:20,560 --> 00:38:23,760
This is all for the sake of destroying the demons.

666
00:38:24,680 --> 00:38:25,320
Push through.

667
00:38:25,660 --> 00:38:26,960
For the sake of a master.

668
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:30,600
For the sake of the demon slayers who've lost their lives.

669
00:38:31,260 --> 00:38:34,200
For the sake of all living people counting on us.

670
00:38:34,200 --> 00:38:37,660
We must see our endeavors through to the end.

671
00:38:37,660 --> 00:38:39,860
We must strive.

672
00:38:39,860 --> 00:38:49,660
What's going on?

673
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:52,440
Ow!

674
00:38:56,560 --> 00:38:57,260
I'm bleeding!

675
00:38:57,780 --> 00:38:59,200
What's the big idea, huh?

676
00:38:59,340 --> 00:39:00,040
That hurt!

677
00:39:02,720 --> 00:39:03,160
Emergency!

678
00:39:03,580 --> 00:39:04,020
Emergency!

679
00:39:04,600 --> 00:39:06,280
I bear a letter from the master!

680
00:39:06,620 --> 00:39:07,820
Read it without delay!

681
00:39:07,820 --> 00:39:10,260
A letter? To me? Are you sure?

682
00:39:10,980 --> 00:39:12,560
Huh. Let's see.

683
00:39:16,420 --> 00:39:20,480
Mr. Tomioka. He's not taking part in the Hashira training.

684
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:46,180
Master Kagaia. It seems the Hashira, preparing for what's to come, have all united and started training the other swordsmen.

685
00:39:46,180 --> 00:39:53,140
Your children are carrying out your will, and making sure your hopes live on.

686
00:39:54,120 --> 00:39:56,260
As we speak, they're training their hardest.

687
00:39:57,500 --> 00:40:03,100
All for the sake of your ardent desire to defeat Muzan Kibutsuji once and for all.

688
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:10,040
Amane.

689
00:40:12,080 --> 00:40:12,720
Yes?

690
00:40:16,180 --> 00:40:21,180
Thank you... for everything... you've done.

691
00:40:31,180 --> 00:40:31,960
Yes.

692
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:45,480
...

693
00:40:45,480 --> 00:41:15,460
Thank you.

694
00:41:15,480 --> 00:41:20,460
Good evening, Miss Tamayo.

695
00:41:27,100 --> 00:41:31,320
It's dangerous, you know, leaving your window open at night like this.

696
00:41:36,220 --> 00:41:39,560
I don't blame you, the moon is truly gorgeous tonight.

697
00:41:40,980 --> 00:41:42,180
Nice to meet you.

698
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:43,920
No need to worry.

699
00:41:43,920 --> 00:41:46,840
I am one of Kaguya Ubuyashiki's messengers.

700
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:52,520
I must say, you really are quite adept at hiding.

701
00:41:53,360 --> 00:41:58,020
So much so that in the time it took to find you, Ubuyashiki has become immobile.

702
00:41:59,120 --> 00:42:02,560
If you don't mind sharing, how did you find me?

703
00:42:03,860 --> 00:42:05,580
Merely through human connections.

704
00:42:05,580 --> 00:42:10,320
I was able to identify the former owner of this house that you purchased.

705
00:42:11,120 --> 00:42:16,800
Not only that, but during the day, I kept a watchful eye on Yushiro's whereabouts.

706
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:22,380
And while I may have received some amount of training, I am a mere crow.

707
00:42:22,380 --> 00:42:26,040
In other words, no one would ever be wary of me.

708
00:42:27,100 --> 00:42:29,660
Please know that I have no intention of harming you.

709
00:42:30,180 --> 00:42:31,160
I come in peace.

710
00:42:31,160 --> 00:42:33,660
All right.

711
00:42:34,080 --> 00:42:35,980
Then what is it you want with me?

712
00:42:37,380 --> 00:42:40,540
I understand you have suspicions.

713
00:42:41,300 --> 00:42:42,180
I don't blame you.

714
00:42:43,020 --> 00:42:48,160
I already assumed before meeting you that it would be hard to gain your trust the way Tanjiro has.

715
00:42:49,000 --> 00:42:49,420
Oh well.

716
00:42:49,420 --> 00:42:54,360
What does he intend to do, Ubuyashiki?

717
00:42:55,140 --> 00:42:57,100
Is he trying to deceive me somehow?

718
00:42:58,780 --> 00:42:59,780
And Yushiro?

719
00:43:00,520 --> 00:43:02,940
You have my word that Yushiro is safe.

720
00:43:04,660 --> 00:43:05,220
Listen.

721
00:43:05,940 --> 00:43:08,100
You can hear his footsteps running towards us.

722
00:43:10,040 --> 00:43:11,060
And now,

723
00:43:12,260 --> 00:43:14,200
shall I state my business coming here?

724
00:43:14,200 --> 00:43:17,620
In the Demon Slayer Corps,

725
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:19,320
there is a young girl

726
00:43:19,320 --> 00:43:22,400
who is also well-versed in demon physiology.

727
00:43:23,460 --> 00:43:25,480
We'd like you to collaborate with her

728
00:43:25,480 --> 00:43:28,200
and look into the changes to Nezuko.

729
00:43:30,760 --> 00:43:33,120
Help us defeat Muzan Kibutsuji.

730
00:43:33,460 --> 00:43:34,640
The decision is yours.

731
00:43:36,460 --> 00:43:39,180
We'll be waiting for you at the Ubuyashiki mansion.

732
00:43:40,520 --> 00:43:42,680
You're summoning me, a demon,

733
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:45,520
to the headquarters of the Demon Slayer Corps?

734
00:43:45,520 --> 00:43:45,560
To the headquarters of the Demon Slayer Corps?

735
00:44:12,680 --> 00:44:14,680
We'll be waiting for you.

736
00:44:14,720 --> 00:44:15,100
I'm not a fan.

737
00:44:27,360 --> 00:44:27,620
We're bound to the flank,

738
00:44:28,060 --> 00:44:29,800
but it is so important to him.

739
00:44:31,960 --> 00:44:33,320
This is the Cons draining and stable

740
00:44:34,400 --> 00:44:36,160
The duda being

741
00:44:36,620 --> 00:44:37,680
Is here

742
00:44:38,000 --> 00:44:41,040
The Lazarus

743
00:44:41,040 --> 00:44:50,160
Thank you.

744
00:44:51,120 --> 00:45:01,600
What do you wish to go?

745
00:45:01,600 --> 00:45:05,660
Thank you.

746
00:45:05,660 --> 00:45:19,060
Let's go Gonzaga!

747
00:45:35,660 --> 00:46:05,640
We'll be right back.

748
00:46:05,660 --> 00:46:35,640
We'll be right back.

749
00:46:35,660 --> 00:47:05,640
We'll be right back.

750
00:47:05,660 --> 00:47:35,640
We'll be right back.

751
00:47:35,660 --> 00:48:05,640
We'll be right back.

752
00:48:05,640 --> 00:48:08,580
What are you going to do about all this broken glass?

753
00:48:09,080 --> 00:48:10,260
I don't know.

754
00:48:10,400 --> 00:48:10,920
Bad boy!

755
00:48:10,920 --> 00:48:15,920
You always stay positive, and I like that about you, Inosuke.

756
00:48:15,920 --> 00:48:18,580
But there are things that you mustn't do.

757
00:48:19,140 --> 00:48:22,680
Now, hold up your arm so I can tend to your wound.

758
00:48:23,640 --> 00:48:26,280
Don't ever do anything like this again, all right?

759
00:48:26,280 --> 00:48:36,200
Miss Shinobu can be strict whenever she needs to be, but she's bursting with compassion, like

760
00:48:36,200 --> 00:48:37,500
back at the Hashira meeting.

761
00:48:39,500 --> 00:48:40,940
Here, Miss Kanroji.

762
00:48:40,940 --> 00:48:43,280
Oh, thank you.

763
00:48:43,280 --> 00:48:45,080
You're very welcome, dear.

764
00:48:45,880 --> 00:48:48,640
And that's it for today's Taisho-era secret.

765
00:48:49,360 --> 00:48:53,180
Next, episode two, Water Hashira Giyutomioka's Pain.

